      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The recollision picture made a surprising strong-field phenomenon intelligible and supplied the conceptual basis for high-harmonic and attosecond science.",
        "attribution": "Corkum's physical model and the Lewenstein and Schafer theoretical formulations form a coherent, closely connected contribution.",
        "maturity": "The ideas have been tested extensively in many atoms, molecules, and laboratories and underpin a mature experimental field.",
