      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The trapped-ion and ultracold-atom proposals established experimentally fruitful routes to quantum computation and controllable quantum simulation.",
        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller developed seminal theoretical architectures, and Blatt provided decisive trapped-ion experimental realization.",
        "maturity": "The central protocols have been realized and extended widely, though the larger technological promise remains in development.",
        "uncertainties": [
