        "attribution": "The listed scientists represent complementary advances in antihydrogen production, trapping, spectroscopy, and precision comparison.",
        "maturity": "The experimental program has delivered increasingly stringent and careful measurements over many years.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The ultimate discovery significance depends on whether these tests reveal a departure from established symmetry."
        ]
      }
    },
